memory/

# Backup files (editor autosave, refactor .bak artifacts)
*.bak
*.bak.ts
# Patch/merge residue: `patch` writes .orig on a fuzzy-context mismatch, which
# lands the rejected pre-image INSIDE src/ and pollutes git status. Observed live:
# src/index.ts.runbench.orig survived every existing .bak guard.
*.orig
*.rej
